      "content": "NORTHCHURCH            \tHIGH STREET SP 90 NE \t\t\t\t\t(north side)                                         3/245 29.7.50                                 \tChurch of Saint Mary -                                      \t\tI Saxon south wall and part of west wall.  C13 chancel with C15 windows.  C13 and C14 transepts.  C15 tower at crossing.  C19 north aisle and porch.  Nave heightened in C15.  Finely carved wall monument of 1730.  Brass of 1785 to Peter of Hertswold, with engraved head after Bartolozzie. Listing NGR: SP9744008833"
